s/Individual Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Individual 8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Individual 9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Individual 10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">Relay 0 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem B\">Relay 0 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_C\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem C\">Relay 0 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A\">Relay 1 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B\">Relay 1 B</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Relay 1 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem A\">Relay 2 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 2 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem C (page does not exist)\">Relay 2 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem A (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem C (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Team 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2\">Team 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Team 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Team 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Team 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 6 (